// Publishes as a flat `404.html`, the file a static host serves for an
// unmatched URL. Every theme here binds it to its own `not-found.typ`.
#let frontmatter = (
  title: "Not found",
  template: "not-found.typ",
)

Nothing is published at that address. It may have moved, or the link that
brought you here may have been wrong.
